<title>UK: UK M0 grows provisional 6.4 pct in year to March.</title>
<headline>UK M0 grows provisional 6.4 pct in year to March.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England released the following provisional data on M0 money supply -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY (in pct)	   March		Feb*</p>
<p>    M0 in month (adjusted)	  0.5		  0.2</p>
<p>    M0 annual (adjusted)	    6.4		  6.4</p>
<p>    M0 in month (unadjusted) 1.8	  -0.9</p>
<p>    M0 annual (unadjusted)	  7.1		  6.3</p>
<p>* previously reported</p>
<p>NOTE - consensus forecast 6.5 pct yr/yr s/adj growth.</p>
</text>
